<title>UK: IBCA rates L-bank yen samurai bond at AAA.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates L-bank yen samurai bond at AAA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European credit rating agency, said on Friday it had assigned an AAA rating to Landeskreditbank Baden-Wuerttemberg's 20 billion yen three percent reverse dual currency samurai bond due 2007.</p>
<p>&quot;The rating is based on the implied federal German guarantee for the obligations of L-bank,&quot; IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 8682</p>
</text>
